I am travelling to the office on the bus.
Outside, there is heavy rain.
I look outside through the wet window.
The roads are full of water.
This is my first birthday away from home.
I remember the month of January.
I came to Kochi in January.
Back then, I did not know anyone here.
I was very scared.
Now, many things have changed.
I have found good friends.
I have learned new things about this city.
On my first day, I travelled on this same bus.
This same road feels like my own now.
The bus reaches Infopark.
I open my umbrella and walk to the office.
